          <profiles>
            <profile name="Boom of Change" typeId="f7ae-1618-90a8-558c" typeName="Psychic Power (Augment/HEX)" hidden="false" id="2e9e-8a14-427f-5c89">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Warp Charge" typeId="073a-3360-beab-6247">7</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Range" typeId="59ce-10fb-8689-2d17">18&quot;</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Details" typeId="f78e-01c6-7e67-f2db">select a friendly TZEENTCH DAEMON unit within 18&quot; of the psyker and roll a D3. Consult the table below to discover what characteristic bonus all models in that unit receive until the start of your next Psychic phase.


D3 Effect
1 Extra Limb: +1 Attack
2 Mystic Strength: +1 Strength
3 Iron Skin: +1 Toughness</characteristic>
